{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"plan\": \"全曲按“离开后的空落—舍不得旧日亲近—反复权衡是否回去—带着想念继续生活”推进。“空落、悬着”前后呼应，“亲近、被当作自己人”多次回返；“步子”从试探、失序到重新迈开。后段让“想念”与“不再忍让”并存，最后落在珍惜可能的相逢，也愿意独自好好生活。feel按珠子分组，同珠碎片相邻，长段铺开，短段收紧。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"离开以后，他起初总算不用再委屈自己了。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"不用再委屈\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"安心\",\n          \"from\": [\"S01-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"沉甸甸的和弦\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像要宣告什么\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"琶音接不住\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像烟雾往上散\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"声音轻下来\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"越飘越远\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"悬在半空\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像一次召唤\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"停顿里等回声\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"可他很快空落下来，想往前走却不知靠什么安心。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"空落下来\", \"不知靠什么安心\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n          \"from\": [\"S01-2\", \"S01-3\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"硬把背挺直\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不能倒下\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心里却游移\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"尊严还在\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"方向不稳\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"使不上力\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"其实想停下\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"短句像叹息\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"刚冒头就断\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"长停顿截住\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"余音慢慢散尽\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"冷空气\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心里堵着\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"说不清是愤怒\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还是遗憾\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"又像怀念\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"找不到说法\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"刚从昏沉醒来\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"四周冷而空\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"胸口发紧\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"视线还模糊\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"手还在发抖\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"伸手去摸\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"只摸到虚空\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不知身在何处\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"没哭出来\", \"bead\": \"S01-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"旧场景忽然回来\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"9–17\"},\n            {\"text\": \"熟悉的声音\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"9–17\"},\n            {\"text\": \"当时的光线\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"9–17\"},\n            {\"text\": \"记忆变清晰\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"9–17\"},\n            {\"text\": \"过去却回不来\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"9–17\"},\n            {\"text\": \"身体先记起舞步\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"18–23\"},\n            {\"text\": \"隐约记起步子\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"18–23\"},\n            {\"text\": \"脚下有了牵引\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"18–23\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还没真正站稳\", \"bead\": \"S01-B5\", \"bars\": \"18–23\"}\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"舍不得从前的自在，他又怕一心软忘了为何离开。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"从前的自在\", \"为何离开\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"不安\",\n          \"from\": [\"S02-1\", \"S02-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"像远处传来的旧歌\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"依稀还认得\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"只哼得出几句\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"舞步带着庄严\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像唱给众人听\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"私下低声哼唱\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"珍惜的东西还在\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"却不能再拥有\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"回不到从前\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"不是士兵步伐\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"腿脚有些虚浮\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"记忆里挪着舞步\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"节奏庄严傲慢\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"旋律脆弱凄婉\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"细碎半音蠕动\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"底下总不安生\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"猛地往上冲\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"38–43\"},\n            {\"text\": \"又退了下来\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"38–43\"},\n            {\"text\": \"重新聚起力量\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"44–65\"},\n            {\"text\": \"越到后来越焦灼\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"52–63\"},\n            {\"text\": \"始终没能落稳\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"44–65\"},\n            {\"text\": \"三连音连绵不断\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"56–65\"},\n            {\"text\": \"呼吸越来越急\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"56–65\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"把衣服整理好\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"抬起头来\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不让人看出动摇\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像在说我没事\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"第一次还相信\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"第二次努力相信\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"第三次还在重复\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"越说越显得在意\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"悲伤仍在\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不肯交给悲伤\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"可他不甘心，难道连从前的好日子也得丢掉？\",\n          \"keys\": [\"不甘心\", \"好日子\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"炽热\",\n          \"from\": [\"S02-3\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"不甘心就此消亡\", \"bead\": \"S02-B5\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不是轻松恢复自信\", \"bead\": \"S02-B5\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"咬着牙不服\", \"bead\": \"S02-B5\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不肯就这样垮掉\", \"bead\": \"S02-B5\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他还憋着气，却因想起旧日亲近而高兴片刻。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"憋着气\", \"高兴片刻\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"欢喜\",\n          \"from\": [\"S03-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"重锤砸下来\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"66\"},\n            {\"text\": \"带着怒气\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"抗拒一下涌上来\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心里一悬\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"忽强忽弱\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"切分得不安生\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"端正步子散开\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"变成灵活舞步\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"想往前走却定不下方向\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"前半段很焦躁\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"66–79\"},\n            {\"text\": \"急切地往前赶\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"66–79\"},\n            {\"text\": \"后半段忽然柔和\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"亲切得像故乡\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像夏日麦浪\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"微风轻轻吹过\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不用时时防备\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"温柔得让人心颤\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"越怀念越刺痛\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"},\n            {\"text\": \"眼前和从前隔很远\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"80–91\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"可那点高兴很快变酸：离开后，日子真会更好吗？\",\n          \"keys\": [\"变酸\", \"更好吗\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n          \"from\": [\"S03-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"暂时侧身离开\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不再正面迎着\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"聊点别的\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"出去走走\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"注意力离开伤口\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"轻松是真的\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心里的事没答案\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"几个人低声絮语\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"声音缠在一起\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"找不到出口\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"重心抓不住\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像踩进流沙\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"四处漂移\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心里没个准头\", \"bead\": \"S03-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"昂扬慢慢退潮\", \"bead\": \"S03-B5\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"流动而含蓄\", \"bead\": \"S03-B5\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"若有所思\", \"bead\": \"S03-B5\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"我刚才真信了吗？\", \"bead\": \"S03-B5\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还是在劝自己？\", \"bead\": \"S03-B5\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"想起从前亲近的日子，他一度盼着还能那样相处。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"亲近的日子\", \"盼着\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"亲密\",\n          \"from\": [\"S04-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"熟悉的主题回来\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"伴奏流动起来\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像在独自说话\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"旧记忆鲜活\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"感激与亲密\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"柔情涌上来\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"短暂的幸福\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"姿态变柔软\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"里面有回声\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"更容易受伤\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"努力想要坚定\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"可当初的委屈也翻上来，他反复问自己走得对不对。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"委屈\", \"对不对\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n          \"from\": [\"S04-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"温暖没能持续\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"108–115\"},\n            {\"text\": \"忽然风暴般激烈\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"108–115\"},\n            {\"text\": \"整段绷得很紧\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"108–115\"},\n            {\"text\": \"越用力越不稳\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"108–115\"},\n            {\"text\": \"记忆太好反而刺痛\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"108–115\"},\n            {\"text\": \"过去回不来了\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"108–115\"},